<div class="container textBtext ">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-12">
							<div class="body2  textColorBlack weightBook text-item-body"><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h6>InBroker® Corporate Services</h6><p>Aimed at companies who want to view, use and analyze stock market information.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h6>MARKETorder/InBroker® for Brokers&nbsp;</h6><p>Aimed at companies who want to give internal users the ability to view, use and analyze stock market information as well as trade on the market (Execution Order Management System – EOMS).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h6>MARKETorder/InBroker® for Brokers &amp; Retail</h6><p>Same as MARKETorder/InBroker® for Brokers (above) but includes internal as well as external users (investors, cooperators, etc.).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h6>InBroker® Business Accounts</h6><p>Target audience is company executives, who are interested in viewing and analyzing stock market information.</p></div>
					</div>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
